WEBVTT

00:00:16.940 --> 00:00:19.770
This is because Kana is an idiot.

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:23.000
I don't want an idiot to call me that!

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:24.330
You are an idiot.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:29.610
Hey hey, you said it ... You're...

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:30.330
Spring is like the whipping of idiots so that they run faster.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.450
It's not like that!

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:33.330
Spring is like the whipping of idiots so that they run faster.

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:45.250
Hey idiots.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:49.310
Could you guys keep it down? I was sleeping.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:51.150
Sorry.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.550
Really.

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.430
Who were you referring to just now?

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:03.760
What did Chiaki of the Minami family have as an upbringing

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:06.930
when there is such a great sister like Kana-chan.

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:13.730
Do you want a fight? You want a fight!?

00:01:13.730 --> 00:01:15.910
Bring it on, you idiot!

00:01:16.830 --> 00:01:18.670
Uchida! I choose you!

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:19.660
Why me?

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:30.520
The gong sounds for the start of "Springtime! The Best at Quarrelling"!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.160
Maki-san will be explaining.

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:33.960
Thanks.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:34.860
Good afternoon.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.800
Oh, it's about to begin.

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:38.780
Yep, it is.

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:42.230
This is a one-bout match with no time limit, but...

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:46.090
I believe, it will end before Haruka finishes preparing the snacks.

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:46.810
I see.

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:49.990
How will this battle progress?

00:01:49.990 --> 00:01:52.230
Let's see...

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.420
The undefeated champion will win in a flash, right?

00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.480
Oh, I feel that too!

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:00.630
See, the challenger has no intention of winning!

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.350
On the other side, it looks like we have a tag-team champion!

00:02:22.370 --> 00:02:23.990
Erm Chiaki...

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:27.100
If you really want to sleep, why don't you go back to your room and sleep?

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.950
No!

00:02:33.770 --> 00:02:37.510
The champion is strong! She will protect the warm place till the end!

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:40.990
That was no cheap trick! She used all her force.

00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.030
The challenger has lost all her strength.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.320
Will she get up?

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:49.120
If she can't get up, she can't win!

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.190
Touch!

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.550
Ok! Leave it to me!

00:03:07.890 --> 00:03:09.470
The champion is strong!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:15.840
It can't be helped. Let me, the unreasonable champion, do it.

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:16.650
Kana-chan!

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:20.390
Hey Chiaki.

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:21.520
What?

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:23.800
It's warm here, right?

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.500
Yep.

00:03:26.380 --> 00:03:28.000
There are other spots with warmth too, right?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:29.080
Warm places.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.100
Nope.

00:03:31.970 --> 00:03:34.130
That means you don't want to move, right?

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.670
Of course.

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:38.310
No matter what?

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:40.000
No matter what.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.950
Snacks are ready.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.290
I made sakura mochi today.

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.510
Here, eat up.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:53.510
Eh? You can make sakura mochi on your own too?

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:55.560
It looks tasty.

00:03:58.250 --> 00:03:59.520
Don't move.

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:10.310
Thanks for the food!

00:04:14.360 --> 00:04:17.630
Tasty!

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:19.630
That's great!

00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:27.490
Don't move.

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.620
Let me go!

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.800
Weren't they arguing?

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.730
They get along well, huh?

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:22.610
I don't feel like doing anything.

00:06:22.610 --> 00:06:24.340
Let's take an afternoon nap?

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:28.910
Eh? Let's play something.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:34.540
Kana, someone is here.

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:40.640
Come on, Kana-chan if you don't open the door...

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:42.440
Sorry for the Intrusion.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.900
it won't good...

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.760
Eh? Where's Haruka?

00:06:45.760 --> 00:06:47.560
Ah, it's Maki-chan.

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:49.900
Haruka has gone shopping, so she'll be back later.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:51.070
I see.

00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:53.780
Kana-chan, I have something I would like to ask of you.

00:06:54.490 --> 00:06:55.320
What?

00:06:55.560 --> 00:06:57.810
I'd like you to look at my sleeping face.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:00.200
Is it the latest fad for proposing?

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:04.520
It was the morning of a day during my junior high graduation trip.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:06.390
When I woke up...

00:07:11.440 --> 00:07:12.730
That was funny!

00:07:13.290 --> 00:07:16.590
Maki, what's that?

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:19.070
What's what?

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.560
Then I suddenly wondered...

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:26.690
if I show the whites of my eyes when I sleep!

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:29.780
Why did you bring it up suddenly?

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:30.530
Suddenly?

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:32.820
Yeah?

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.200
Suddenly?

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:38.360
From then on, I couldn't sleep properly unless I slept alone right?

00:07:39.240 --> 00:07:48.300
From then on?

00:07:49.890 --> 00:07:50.950
You!

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:51.490
What?

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:53.840
You're just a little kid, what are you so concerned about it?

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:54.840
That's rude.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.410
What are you?

00:07:56.410 --> 00:07:57.450
You talking about me?

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:59.260
Then compare with me!

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.480
Don't come here!

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.470
How is it?

00:08:03.470 --> 00:08:04.790
Don't compare!

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:08.490
Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:08:09.650 --> 00:08:12.030
I think I'll try to sleep then.

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.200
It won't work, you won't find anyone like that.

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:17.450
Why?

00:08:17.720 --> 00:08:18.970
I said it before.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.790
A prince is a creature that only appears in fantasies.

00:08:21.990 --> 00:08:24.480
But, Chiaki still believes in Santa.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.250
I have the freedom to believe!

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.960
And you can't become a princess.

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:32.370
How can Chiaki be so mature...

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:33.800
Maki-chan.

00:08:33.800 --> 00:08:35.170
What do you want to do?

00:08:35.850 --> 00:08:36.550
Oh yeah...

00:08:36.930 --> 00:08:38.640
I must confirm!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.970
Let's sleep together!

00:08:40.970 --> 00:08:43.100
No, help me confirm.

00:08:45.310 --> 00:08:47.870
Ok, we're sleep.

00:08:47.870 --> 00:08:49.390
We'll leave the confirmation to you.

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:52.710
What's with that? You wouldn't sleep with me!

00:09:11.670 --> 00:09:14.560
They look like they are sleeping well.

00:09:14.560 --> 00:09:16.760
I am getting sleepy too.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:19.700
Hey Kana... Let's...

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.730
What?

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:39.170
Ok.

00:09:40.030 --> 00:09:40.980
Kana.

00:09:48.310 --> 00:09:51.790
It hurts.

00:10:02.970 --> 00:10:03.970
Hot pot.

00:10:12.920 --> 00:10:15.520
Uchida... Look at her.

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:18.530
My stomach hurts!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.620
I knew it!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:25.990
I'm back, it's very lively in here.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:27.410
Did something happen?

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:31.100
Hey Kana, what's the matter?

00:10:31.490 --> 00:10:32.960
What is it?

00:10:50.060 --> 00:10:51.370
Princess?

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:59.770
This was in the 2nd year, right?

00:11:00.420 --> 00:11:02.740
This girl was from our neighbouring class right?

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:05.700
She took the entrance exams of our high school with us.

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.650
Is this you, Atsuko?

00:11:08.650 --> 00:11:12.540
Yeah. They're all photos of me when I was little.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:15.830
What are you looking at?

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:18.590
Atsuko's junior high school photos.

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.240
Speaking of which, it's the same school as Maki-chan, right?

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:23.800
Yep.

00:11:28.420 --> 00:11:29.220
Eh?

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:33.280
Did Maki-chan have a sleeping face that was so tempting to draw on back then too?

00:11:34.850 --> 00:11:36.820
I can't say...

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:00.300
I'm back.

00:12:00.540 --> 00:12:02.030
Welcome back.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.800
Chiaki, what are you doing?

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:08.480
A button came off, I was sewing it back on.

00:12:14.820 --> 00:12:18.120
Haruka left her clothes lying around again.

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.820
That's the untidy part about her.

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.400
Come to think of it, there's only 4 more days till the seasons change.

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.080
Yep.

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:35.370
Oh right, speaking of changing seasons.

00:12:41.340 --> 00:12:43.380
Can you make this a half-sleeve?

00:12:44.670 --> 00:12:46.470
I can't say I'll do it very well.

00:12:46.700 --> 00:12:48.510
Treat it as practise.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:54.500
Let's use this seasonal change of clothes to let ourselves be reborn!

00:12:54.500 --> 00:12:55.880
To become more beautiful.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:59.150
Ok, fine. Go reborn yourself all you want.

00:13:00.160 --> 00:13:03.690
What? Let's do it together.

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:04.750
I don't want to.

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:09.320
But, somewhere hidden inside your heart, there is a desire to change, right?

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:11.580
Nope, I don't have that inside me.

00:13:11.580 --> 00:13:14.450
Then, let's go on a journey with that.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:17.500
I don't want to become like that.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.700
Here. Done.

00:13:19.700 --> 00:13:20.840
Thank you, Chiaki.

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.380
Goodbye, my former self.

00:13:23.920 --> 00:13:24.760
Eh?

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.460
What's wrong?

00:13:33.850 --> 00:13:36.730
Whose skirt is this?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:38.750
Haruka's.

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.690
Why is the skirt cut?

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:45.650
Then to have mistakenly cut them together...

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:50.390
Why did you leave it on the table?

00:13:50.390 --> 00:13:53.370
I was planning to tidy it up.

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:57.870
It's all your fault!

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.140
How is it, Chiaki?

00:14:17.800 --> 00:14:21.100
I did an emergency patch, it should hold for some time.

00:14:21.590 --> 00:14:24.520
It will go for cleaning in 4 days.

00:14:24.520 --> 00:14:27.060
If we can't think of a way by then.

00:14:28.160 --> 00:14:30.730
To say it or not to say it?

00:14:30.730 --> 00:14:33.910
Don't say it. Think about how to be honest!

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:35.120
Oh!

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.640
I'm back.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:43.310
Welcome back, Haruka-neesama.

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.120
What's the matter, you two?

00:14:45.120 --> 00:14:47.570
Nothing.

00:14:47.570 --> 00:14:48.800
Really?

00:14:56.170 --> 00:14:59.560
What can I do to make my sleeping face look better?

00:14:59.560 --> 00:15:01.770
I think it's really cute already.

00:15:02.410 --> 00:15:03.600
Yep.

00:15:06.320 --> 00:15:10.570
Haruka-chan, your bento the other day was really good.

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:12.240
Thanks.

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:14.230
I hope you make it again.

00:15:14.230 --> 00:15:14.870
Ok.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.290
Ok, we'll stop here today.

00:15:20.200 --> 00:15:22.140
Ah! It's over!

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:23.680
Let's eat together.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:24.530
Ok.

00:15:27.820 --> 00:15:29.310
There you go again.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.670
Don't hide.

00:15:31.000 --> 00:15:34.490
No. It's because my sister is always in her care.

00:15:34.490 --> 00:15:36.870
I was wondering if it was a bother to her.

00:15:36.870 --> 00:15:38.510
There is no need to hide.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:40.950
I understand.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:46.740
Using your sister as an excuse to use the "ah, such a nice elder brother" appeal on Haruka.

00:15:46.740 --> 00:15:48.650
Nope. It's not true.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.790
Nope. It's not true at all.

00:15:53.790 --> 00:15:56.540
Using such deliberate actions, you're making me think otherwise.

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.410
Ah Natsuki-kun.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:00.180
What's the matter?

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:02.330
Thanks for always looking after Touma.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:05.250
Eh? You came all the way to tell me that?

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.560
You shouldn't have...

00:16:08.550 --> 00:16:09.270
Eh?

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:13.140
Haruka, your skirt has a loose thread.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:14.470
Eh, where?

00:16:15.220 --> 00:16:16.220
Here.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:18.850
There really is...

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:38.020
Hey Kana...

00:16:38.020 --> 00:16:39.850
What are you thinking?

00:16:44.240 --> 00:16:46.220
I think it's better not to change.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:48.100
It's fine to continue to be like the present.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:50.380
I am talking about Haruka-neesama's skirt.

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:53.270
It has nothing to do with you changing.

00:16:53.270 --> 00:16:54.700
Change?

00:16:55.890 --> 00:16:58.800
Can you say that something from the past does not have any value?

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:02.060
Haruka-neesama?

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:04.680
Remembering the painful things from the past.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:08.220
For the sake of tomorrow's happiness, what should I do?

00:17:08.220 --> 00:17:09.380
Please tell me.

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:12.970
What is she talking about?

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:14.570
I don't know.

00:18:45.790 --> 00:18:48.980
Yeah... Sorry about that...

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:53.830
Hey, why did you think it became that way?

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:57.960
It's because you are an idiot, isn't it?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:08.010
I've had enough of this!

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:14.650
You always say "idiot" in every other sentence.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:18.190
It's stabbing at my heart, I can't take it anymore!

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:21.240
I can't talk properly with you anymore!

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:24.950
That...

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:29.830
What I meant saying that is... a good intentioned idiot...

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:31.980
What's with that?

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:35.130
An idiot is a hair's breadth away from genius.

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:44.330
An idiot is a hair's breadth away from genius.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:47.590
So you're still calling me an idiot!

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:01.240
Isn't this domestic violence?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:05.360
When did you become this kind of child?

00:20:09.480 --> 00:20:11.810
It must be because of a lack of love, huh?

00:20:15.110 --> 00:20:17.480
Before she becomes a delinquent...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:19.340
If I don't correct her...

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.330
An awkward atmosphere...

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:34.040
Chiaki.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:34.770
What is it?

00:20:35.310 --> 00:20:37.090
How is school?

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.710
It isn't too bad.

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:43.600
That's good to hear...

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.830
What's with that?

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:53.110
Let's eat.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:57.780
Chiaki.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.910
Yeah?

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:03.220
Chiaki, you like fried stuff, right?

00:21:04.550 --> 00:21:06.220
I like them but...

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.590
Here, you can have this.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:11.450
It's fine. That's alright.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.990
Fried food should be eaten hot.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:14.890
Here!

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:17.940
But, it is not good to eat too much.

00:21:17.940 --> 00:21:20.690
I want you to eat more so that you can grow up.

00:21:21.120 --> 00:21:23.650
She wants me to fatten me, right?

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.300
What's the matter, you two?

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.310
You guys are getting along really well.

00:21:28.310 --> 00:21:29.030
Here.

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:32.950
It's fine.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:37.640
Really.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:50.530
What do you want?

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.010
Let me wash your back.

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:56.600
No, it's not good.

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.080
Don't be modest, Chiaki.

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.300
I'm not being modest.

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:06.860
Chiaki, Chiaki!

00:22:06.860 --> 00:22:08.710
Let me wash your back.

00:22:08.710 --> 00:22:11.680
Leave me alone!

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:18.410
What's gotten into her? That Kana...

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:25.550
She wants to eat me after washing me well?

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:35.170
You are late.

00:22:43.380 --> 00:22:44.980
Come here.

00:22:46.460 --> 00:22:48.500
I'll read you a bedtime story before you go to sleep.

00:22:49.110 --> 00:22:49.970
Here.

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:51.860
This is.

00:22:52.190 --> 00:22:54.370
I can't read the kanji at the beginning!

00:22:55.280 --> 00:22:58.150
It's really a hard book.

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:07.300
Haruka-neesama.

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:09.050
Yes?

00:23:13.210 --> 00:23:15.120
What's the matter, Chiaki?

00:23:16.230 --> 00:23:17.320
Erm.

00:23:19.260 --> 00:23:22.690
If I sleep, I'll be eaten...

00:23:24.690 --> 00:23:26.230
Eaten?

00:23:30.820 --> 00:23:33.640
You shouldn't worry about your sleeping face.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.460
You make me a bit worried.

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:37.870
Both of you look cute when sleeping.

00:23:38.070 --> 00:23:40.660
Next time on Minami-ke Okaeri.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:42.350
We are together, okay?

00:23:42.350 --> 00:23:44.630
Please don't look, Haruka.
